ito con la giustizia. Ma adesso sono fuori, e devono decidere in che modo spendere il poco tempo che gli è stato concesso. Vendetta, redenzione, riscatto, amore. Una volta usciti ognuno di loro dovrà fare i conti con il mondo che è cambiato mentre erano dentro.","tagline":"La storia di quattro detenuti durante le loro quarantotto ore di licenza che ci mostra la loro realtà e di come sono stati portati dietro le sbarre."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Furlough","overview":"The story of four inmates during their 48 hours furlough, of their reality and how it has brought them behind bars. The characters are described with realism, with their contradictions, their desperation, the temptation of an escape, but the cornerstone of the movie is the sincerity of the positive feelings of each and everyone of them: the love of a father for his son, the love for a woman, for friends, and most of all the pursuit of a lost (if ever had) personal dignity and pride. Four characters of different ages and extractions, three man and a woman: Luigi, Donato, Rossana and Angelo."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3dJsNJfL3CKiRRf39rE0KyI2Wux.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rveP35IRa5Hsoun15ToqU1Vik7T.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":428988,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3dJsNJfL3CKiRRf39rE0KyI2Wux.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3dJsNJfL3CKiRRf39rE0KyI2Wux.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3dJsNJfL3CKiRRf39rE0KyI2Wux.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3dJsNJfL3CKiRRf39rE0KyI2Wux.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k9tY1